            • Rename: double-click label or click ✎<br>
            • Filter by role to focus view<br>
            <hr>
            <strong>Shortcuts:</strong> [F] Fit • [R] Reset filter • [Delete] Remove
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Connection Type Selector (Inline) -->
    <div class="connection-type-selector" id="connectionTypeSelector">
        <div class="connection-type-option" data-type="designation">
            <span>⊡</span>
